      "nets": ["Net-(J3-Pin_3)", "/PWM1"],
      "observed": "R3 is listed as 1M in the netlist and SPICE, while the corresponding resistor R4 is 1k. R3 is the series resistor between /PWM1 and J3 pin 3.",
