          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(value \"1M\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "spice",
          "quote": "R3 Net-_J3-Pin_3_ /PWM1 1Meg"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "In PWM mode, channel 1 servo signal is driven through 1 MΩ instead of 1 kΩ, making it extremely weak and susceptible to noise/RC slowing; the servo may fail to respond or behave erratically while channel 2 remains correct.",
      "confidence": 0.97
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The board's connectivity and most values match the specification, but R3 has a 1MΩ value instead of the specified 1kΩ PWM series resistor, which is a clear functional anomaly."
